e power and force of this deadly miracle and wonder of nature! \n\nHuge fireballs and chunks of earth rain down as hot fast pyroclastic flows run down the mountain side!", "short_description": "Enjoy the Earth Shattering power of a VR Mega Volcano as lava erupts to the surface of this isolated volcanic island in this one of a kind simulation! \n\nEXPLORE  CONTROL  EXPERIENCE\n"}]}, "developer_name": "DM GAMES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dmgames.org/PrivacyVR.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DM GAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dmgames.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9469061089876409"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393826_909887617882833_2527014376940940270_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FiKctxLSvJQQ7kNvwFghXzu&_nc_oc=AdqP3gkyVLkeDzfbVi_rxPCKn_A9QC8hcDO2p6unfRDXygFWzQpCdGzjJS3yVyCEGl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af11-qRB1QdNr1sGWoT9R9xfM686pZWJLY5NTrrLvKEE9g&oe=69F200A1"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Mega Volcano", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"top